# coerce-floor golden — emitted-Go runtime-narrowing token counts.
# FAIL-ON-INCREASE: a count above its golden fails `xtask coerce-floor`.
# A DECREASE is fine (floor tightened) — re-bless to ratchet it down.
# Regenerate with: cargo run -p xtask -- coerce-floor --bless
# Re-key (adds/moves rows) with: cargo run -p xtask -- coerce-floor --rekey,
#   which additionally asserts sum(tokens) and count(rows) did not FALL.
# Format: <key>\t<total-rt-narrowing-token-count>
#   <key> without `/` is an examples/ directory; with `/` it is a
#   repo-root-relative Layer-2 project path (apps/manifest.toml).
